/ActualText (Stationarity: ARIMA assumes that the time series is stationary, meaning that its statistical properties \(mean and variance\) do not change over time. If the series is not stationary, differencing \(determined by the d parameter\) is applied to make it stationary, but making it stationary in the first place is often better.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
217 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
